@startuml terminal_commit_retry
' Source ba9e497c: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeV2ExecutionCoordinator.java
' Symbols: start, terminalOutcome, commitAndRelease, deferTerminal, retryTerminal
' Source ba9e497c: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/runtime/RuntimeTerminalRetryScheduler.java
' Observed behavior: retain holder until authoritative terminal commit succeeds.
' Java divergence: durable terminal recovery is outside the pi Agent loop.
title Runtime terminal commit and retry
participant Coordinator as C
participant "Agent / Holder" as A
database "Execution repository" as D
participant "Response output" as O
participant "Retry scheduler" as R
C -> A : Install handlers and subscriptions
C -> A : Schedule timeout and start prompt
A --> C : Actual completion outcome
C -> C : Freeze terminal ID, time and outcome
C -> D : Commit fixed execution terminal
alt Commit succeeds
  D --> C : Committed
  C -> O : Emit committed idle
  C -> A : Release subscriptions and holder
  C -> O : Complete output
else Commit fails or is uncertain
  D --> C : Error
  C -> A : Remove subscriptions and timeout
  C -> O : Close current output
  note over C,A : Keep holder and credentials for pending terminal
  C -> R : Schedule same terminal plan
  R -> C : Retry without rerunning Agent
  C -> D : Commit same terminal ID and time
end
@enduml
